WEBVTT

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.184
families are scattered,

00:12:31.208 --> 00:12:34.875
there's no communities left
to do these wake things with.

00:12:35.833 --> 00:12:37.309
But again,

00:12:37.333 --> 00:12:39.643
you would be dead wrong.

00:12:39.667 --> 00:12:42.184
We all have the power as individuals

00:12:42.208 --> 00:12:46.226
to reenact the wisdom of our ancestors.

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:48.434
Confronted in our mortality,

00:12:48.458 --> 00:12:51.184
we often feel powerless,

00:12:51.208 --> 00:12:52.458
death-struck.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:57.518
But all you need to do
is rediscover yourself.

00:12:57.542 --> 00:13:00.643
Be a bit more Irish, if you like.